  triage:description "Historical finding FTQ-001 from phase-Xb (.triage/phase-Xb/findings/FTQ-001.ttl, line 15) records triage:status \"open\" for SqliteRuntimeGuard env-race. However, the code fix (env_lock() acquisition in install() and Drop impl) predates this follow-up phase and is present on all current branches (AD.25-AD.30 confirmed). Plan phase-AD.md (line 155-158) and AD.30 sprint requirements (readiness.md line 40) mandate reconciliation: either update the historical TTL to closed, or record an explicit note explaining why the record remains open as provenance only. As of current s30 state, neither reconciliation action has been recorded in the authoritative artifacts." ;
